    stepName: Unscrew lug nut 4
    fetcherText: The Assembler is removing the lug nuts. Next you take the old wheel.
    assemblerText: 
    item: 0
    handoff: 0
  - chapter: 2
    stepName: Unscrew lug nut 5
    fetcherText: The Assembler is removing the lug nuts. Next you take the old wheel.
    assemblerText: 
    item: 0
    handoff: 0
  - chapter: 2
    stepName: Take off wheel
    fetcherText: The Assembler is taking the wheel off. Get ready to take it.
    assemblerText: 
    item: 0
    handoff: 0
  - chapter: 2
    stepName: Hand the old wheel to the Fetcher
    fetcherText: Take the old wheel from the Assembler.
    assemblerText: Hand the old wheel to the Fetcher
    item: 3
    handoff: 2
  - chapter: 2
    stepName: Store the old wheel on the garage tire rack
    fetcherText: Carry the old wheel to the garage and put it on the tire rack.
    assemblerText: Fetcher is storing the old wheel
    item: 3
    handoff: 0
  - chapter: 2
    stepName: End Ch3
    fetcherText: Next you bring the replacement wheel.
    assemblerText: 
    item: 0
    handoff: 0
  - chapter: 3
    stepName: Hand over the replacement wheel
    fetcherText: 'Assembler needs: replacement wheel. Bring it from beside the workbench
