  - chapter: 3
    stepName: Tighten lug nut 4
    fetcherText: The Assembler is snugging each lug nut one turn.
    assemblerText: 
    item: 0
    handoff: 0
  - chapter: 3
    stepName: Tighten lug nut 5
    fetcherText: The Assembler is snugging each lug nut one turn.
    assemblerText: 
    item: 0
    handoff: 0
  - chapter: 3
    stepName: End Ch4
    fetcherText: Next the Assembler lowers the car and hands you the jack.
    assemblerText: 
    item: 0
    handoff: 0
  - chapter: 4
    stepName: Crank jack to lower car
    fetcherText: The Assembler is lowering the car. Next you take the jack.
    assemblerText: 
    item: 0
    handoff: 0
  - chapter: 4
    stepName: Hand the jack to the Fetcher
    fetcherText: Take the jack from the Assembler.
    assemblerText: Hand the jack to the Fetcher
    item: 2
    handoff: 2
  - chapter: 4
    stepName: Tighten lug nut 1
    fetcherText: Put the jack on the RETURN JACK spot in the garage.
    assemblerText: 
    item: 2
    handoff: 0
